WEBVTT

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:50.710
Satou-chan. Good girl.

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:56.860
It looks like there's nothing left
in Satou-chan anymore.

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:58.550
I wonder what happened.

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:02.420
I wonder if that girl

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:04.660
did something to her.

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:09.020
But she's not here anymore.

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:11.940
What should I do?

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:14.400
I've never seen her
like this before.

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:24.410
Satou-chan.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.910
Satou-chan! Satou-chan!
Satou-chan!

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:28.580
Satou-chan!

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:35.670
She must be exhausted.

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:39.340
She's always protecting me,

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:43.150
even though this place is a castle

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:45.270
for both of us.

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:53.360
All right!

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:57.900
I'll take care of the house
for Satou-chan!

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:02.240
Here it is!

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:05.700
Satou-chan's
"I'll do it my way" curry!

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:11.140
Eggplant, pumpkin, meat,

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:12.770
and bell peppers!

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:16.880
It's delicious because
it has lots of different things!

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:23.510
The kids are useless
because of you!

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:27.100
Why don't you go earn some money,
damn it!

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:33.080
That's what you get
for being slow.

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:39.320
Someone once said,
"a person's heart is like a jar."

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:42.400
You can stuff lots of things inside,

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:45.760
but when it breaks,
that person breaks too.

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.990
-Mom!
-No, Shio.

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.890
Don't touch!

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:51.330
It's dangerous.

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:54.850
I'll take care of it. Don't worry.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.630
Pon! Pon! Pon! Pon!

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.680
I have to tidy up before dinner!

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:04.610
Pon! Pon!

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:08.010
But it's not very dusty.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:15.190
Huh?

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:16.750
It's dirty.

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.750
Let's wipe it up!

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:22.110
Good!

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:24.400
It's clean now!

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.200
Isn't it pretty?

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:30.090
This is the only thing

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:33.830
I received from your grandmother
and grandfather.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.140
But I don't know how to put it on.

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:38.500
So I've never worn it before.

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:42.170
It would look good on you, Shio.

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:45.590
I can do your makeup
and tie up your hair.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:50.150
I want to take pictures of you
in this kimono when you get married.

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:52.230
Hey.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:55.450
Stop blabbing.

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:57.940
Hurry up and sell that junk.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.920
I'll be okay.
I just have to put up with this

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:07.000
until he dies someday.
I'm not alone.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.880
I've got the support.
I'll work hard.

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:13.140
My cute kids. Smile,
I'll stay and protect you.

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:14.750
We'll live a happy life.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.510
No, he hits me!
I'm bleeding. It hurts.

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:20.340
I'm sad! No one's there!
I threw it all away.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:23.590
Mom, Dad, I'm sorry!
It's my fault! I didn't know!

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:25.590
He's the devil.
I've been abandoned!

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.650
This is hell! I can't escape!

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:30.410
It's so dark!

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.810
What should I do?

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:35.600
I've never used this before.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:38.770
But I remember

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:41.690
Satou-chan puts her laundry inside,
and--

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:02.420
Mom, look at this!

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:05.550
Did you go outside, Shio?

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:08.150
I told you not to go see anyone!

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:10.280
I didn't see anyone.

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:11.930
You don't understand

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:15.350
how dangerous
and scary it is outside!

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:18.900
Everything turned out wrong
because of you!

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:21.600
And we ran out of money.

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:24.280
I can't take it anymore.

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:27.420
-It's all...
-Sorry.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.820
Sorry, Mom.

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:34.090
No.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:37.640
I'm sorry I'm so stupid.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:39.960
It's all my fault.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.040
Sorry.

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:45.190
Good girl. Good girl.

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:47.440
Pain, pain,

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.130
go away!

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:52.650
Thanks, Shio.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:55.890
I felt like I had many moms.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:59.570
A scary one, a sad one,

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:01.750
and a kind one.

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:03.820
It'll be okay!

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:07.490
He'll come for us someday.

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:11.410
Then everything will be all right.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:19.750
No... If we don't do something,
you're going to break!

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.220
Where is it?

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:24.850
Where is the thing
that can fix this jar?

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:31.860
Mom!

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:34.350
I want to go outside!

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:35.680
Take me!

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:36.860
What?

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:39.520
I'll be fine
as long as I'm with you!

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:40.770
Please!

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:47.860
Okay. Just don't let go of my hand.

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:54.870
Shio, is there somewhere
you want to go?

00:07:58.380 --> 00:07:59.550
You're right.

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:02.870
Staying inside all the time
is no fun.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:08.340
There's so many people
and so many things!

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:10.510
There must be something here.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:13.180
Something that can fix your jar!

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:15.600
Mom, you'll be fine!

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:18.260
I'll make everything okay!

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:27.400
That's right! We can replace it!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.650
Mom! Look at that!

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:30.610
Shio!

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:34.200
I want to make you smile, Mom!

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:44.460
Shio! You can't go outside
ever again!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:47.020
Stay here forever and keep quiet.

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:49.060
Forever!

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:50.770
No!

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:53.310
You're going to break!

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:55.860
Stop saying things
that don't make sense!

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:58.110
Why don't you ever listen to me?

00:08:58.110 --> 00:09:01.640
I didn't do anything! But you just--

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:04.310
Don't do anything ever again!

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:07.360
If you don't do anything,
nothing will ever happen!

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:08.730
That's no good!

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:15.760
Hey!

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:23.040
No!

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.510
Shio.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.180
Let's go.

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:54.650
Mom, where are we going?

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:57.280
Hey, Mom!

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:00.240
Mom!

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:09.290
Goodbye, Shio.

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.510
No!

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:16.590
Mom! No!

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:19.570
Don't leave me! Sorry!

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:21.580
I'll do what you tell me!

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:23.770
I won't act on my own!

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:25.680
Sorry, Mom!

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.310
-Sorry!
-No.

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:35.820
I don't need you anymore.

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:38.990
I should have done this earlier.

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:47.330
Goodbye, Shio.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.680
Goodbye.

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:06.970
I'm not lonely.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:09.480
I have Satou-chan, so I'm fine.

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.620
You too, Satou-chan, right?

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:14.070
You cried when I wasn't here.

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:16.730
You said you love me.

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:20.410
So we have to stay together forever.

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:23.580
Because we're incomplete.

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:27.680
There was always something missing,
and it hurts.

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:32.750
It hurts?

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:38.220
I see!

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:42.050
I was hurting this whole time.

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:46.350
Satou-chan?

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:51.740
Where do you want to go?

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:53.190
Where?

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:55.860
Yeah. For example,
how about up north?

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:59.050
It's cold, but the food is good.

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:01.130
It's nice in the west too.

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:03.530
I want to try living on an island.

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:06.200
It seems relaxing.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:10.050
Maybe it's better to live
among lots of old people

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:11.370
in the countryside.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:15.370
It would be nice to grow food
in our garden.

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:18.050
-As long as I'm with you--
-Satou-chan.

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:20.260
Are you abandoning the castle?

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:23.930
You said so before, right?

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:27.600
This place is a castle
for us to live happily ever after.

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:31.020
As long as we're here,
there's nothing to be scared of.

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:34.020
So that's not true anymore?

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.370
Hey, Satou-chan!

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:38.820
I could work really hard too.

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.490
I'm going to work hard with you!

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.150
Okay?

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:45.420
Wait!

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.660
Here! Curry!

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:54.670
It's delicious since we let it sit!

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:58.040
Let's eat delicious food
and get better! Let's smile!

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:02.340
Here. Here.

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:09.760
It'll be okay, Shio-chan.

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:11.980
Sorry to make you worry.

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:16.100
This castle is going to crumble soon.

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:18.860
Something dirty came in.

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:20.860
So we're going outside.

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:26.230
I know that you're afraid
of the outside world.

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:29.450
But don't worry, you'll be with me.

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:33.620
I'll protect you, Shio-chan.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:37.200
I'll protect you from all the scary
and dirty things.

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:40.840
So you don't have to do anything.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:44.650
Don't worry about anything.

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:47.400
Just call my name
like you always do,

00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:48.800
and smile.

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:52.200
That's enough to keep me going.

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:56.640
As long as I'm with Shio-chan,
I can do anything.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.560
As long as I have love...

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:02.440
The pieces of love
that rain down from you...

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:04.070
I--

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.460
Why are you always like that?

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:09.160
What am I to you?

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:13.700
What am I to you, Satou-chan?

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:16.080
S-Shio-chan?

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:22.300
I love you more than anyone else
in the world.

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:23.590
Liar!

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.020
You have lots of secrets!

00:14:26.020 --> 00:14:29.010
You never tell me
anything important!

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.360
That's not right!

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:32.800
Shio-chan.

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:36.350
There are lots of things
you don't need to know.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:38.230
That's why I don't tell you.

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:41.470
You just have to stay with me.

00:14:41.470 --> 00:14:44.440
That's all I need to feel better.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:48.320
So that means
I don't have to do anything?

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:50.590
That's right! Shio-chan,

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:53.740
all you have to do
is stay with me and smile!

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:58.670
Then, you don't need me here, right?

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:02.880
I'd be just like a doll.

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:14.010
Shio-chan!

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:21.400
What?

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:24.930
"You don't need me here"?
What do you mean?

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:28.240
Why? That's impossible!

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:32.000
Shio-chan! Shio-chan, where are you?

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.330
She hasn't gone outside.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:41.070
Shio-chan.

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:43.230
You're in there, right?

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:46.150
Thanks.

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:50.050
You took care of lots of things
when I wasn't feeling well.

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:52.020
I was really happy.

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:55.720
But I also felt bad about it.

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:59.160
-You had to work hard because of me.
-Hurry.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:02.940
-Hurry up and come out!
-I'm sorry to make you do that.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.160
But it'll be fine now.

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:08.190
I'll never fall apart.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:11.990
I'm going to fight for you,
Shio-chan. Okay?

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:14.200
No! No! No! No!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:16.300
I don't want to be with you.

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:18.160
I hate you, Satou-chan!

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:24.330
Why? Why? Why?

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:28.810
Did I do something wrong?
What did I do?

00:16:41.570 --> 00:16:43.160
Huh?

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:46.870
I can't think about anything else
after what she said.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.500
It's spinning...

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.540
Her words are spinning

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:53.780
through my body, through my veins.

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:56.320
My heart...

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.040
My brain is going to overflow.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.750
-Why?
-I can't stop shaking.

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:04.930
I don't have enough sugar.

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:06.350
I can't think.

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:08.040
I feel sick.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.300
I'm going to become stupid.
This feeling...

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:13.510
Is this

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:16.440
despair?

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:27.020
There's no meaning.

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:31.690
I have no reason to exist
if Shio-chan doesn't want me.

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:34.860
I can't do anything alone.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:37.530
I can only go on if I'm with you.

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:39.760
I don't want to be alone.

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:41.490
Shio-chan!

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:44.120
I don't want to be alone!

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:50.400
She's leaving.
Aren't you going to chase after her?

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:52.850
No.

00:17:52.850 --> 00:17:57.840
Her jar is going to break
if I'm there.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:02.080
I know that now. So it's okay.

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:04.020
Is that love?

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:06.440
Love?

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:08.620
Caring about someone,

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.540
and feeling drawn to them.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:12.860
That's what they call love.

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:14.500
I...

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:16.880
I wanted her to live

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:19.280
so that I could keep living too.

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:21.340
So it wasn't...

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:26.560
It wasn't love...

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:35.770
Your jar is empty,

00:18:35.770 --> 00:18:37.930
but it's not broken.

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:41.150
You believe in something.

00:18:41.150 --> 00:18:44.120
That's why it doesn't break.

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:51.790
I hope it fills up.

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:53.320
That emptiness.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:55.940
With something that sparkles.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:19:00.620
That's right. Satou-chan.

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:03.200
I don't want to be alone either.

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:08.670
That's why I was really happy
to be with you.

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:12.540
But you didn't feel the same way.

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:16.010
You're always working hard alone.

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:20.720
I always felt you were looking
at something really far away.

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:22.230
Satou-chan.

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:26.400
I don't want to just smile
and call your name anymore.

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:28.140
I worry about you.

00:19:30.990 --> 00:19:34.770
I want to do what I can.
I'm going to do it.

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:36.900
Because this is about you.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:39.450
So let's fight together.

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:42.620
I want to protect you too,
Satou-chan.

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:48.330
It hurts to see you get hurt.

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:50.790
We're one and the same!

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.960
So protect me, Satou-chan!

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:57.380
I'm going to protect you too.

00:19:57.850 --> 00:19:59.600
When we die,

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:02.550
I'll be your partner in crime.

00:20:06.190 --> 00:20:08.600
My senses are coming back.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:11.730
The sugar is filling me up.

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:14.860
I'm so happy to be alive!

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:18.790
Is it really okay
to feel this happy?

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:22.890
Shio-chan.

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:25.300
I killed someone.

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:30.010
So we have to leave this place.

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:34.100
Deceiving, hurting,
and stealing from people...

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:37.150
That's what I did this whole time.

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:42.800
Thanks, Shio-chan. Let's fight
and put our lives on the line!

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:47.720
Let's prove our love together!

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:49.370
Okay!

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:55.520
Wherever you are, that's where
my happy sugar life is too.

00:20:56.240 --> 00:20:59.250
Sorry I said I hate you,

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:00.690
Satou-chan.

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:03.880
Good night.

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:14.600
I feel like we spent
a lot of time here.

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:16.880
But it was much shorter

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:19.870
than the time I spent with my mom.

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:22.300
That's so weird.

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:25.650
I'm sad, but I also feel warm.

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:29.180
Maybe it's because
I know I have Satou-chan.

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:34.020
Wow! The stars are so beautiful!

00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:42.370
I'll be okay! It's scary outside,

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:44.500
but it's different this time.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:47.370
Satou-chan is different from my mom.

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:50.340
I want to be with Satou-chan!

00:21:50.340 --> 00:21:52.790
That's what makes me feel
the happiest!

00:21:53.930 --> 00:21:56.460
So please, God!

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:59.020
Don't take it from me!

00:21:59.020 --> 00:22:01.670
Don't take away my life
with Satou-chan!

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:04.350
I don't need anything else!

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:06.550
I don't need you anymore, Mom!

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:08.890
Don't say that, Shio!

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:12.280
Who was that?

00:23:46.160 --> 00:23:48.140
Shio doesn't know

00:23:48.140 --> 00:23:49.900
about Mom.

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:51.990
About what happened that day.

00:23:52.880 --> 00:23:55.560
That's why...

00:23:55.560 --> 00:23:57.000
I have to tell her.

00:23:58.590 --> 00:24:02.260
Instead of loving in order to live,

00:24:02.260 --> 00:24:06.450
what if we could live and die
in order to love?

00:24:06.450 --> 00:24:10.780
11th Life:
An Eternal Moment with You.
